nion? Are fuel costs squeezing your budget?","query":"customer fueling American forecourt","subject":"customer fueling","visual":{"type":"poll","headline":"ARE FUEL COSTS SQUEEZING YOUR BUDGET?","items":["Yes","Not right now"],"sub":"What do you think? Comment below."},"clip":{"url":"https://pixabay.com/get/g6c70d91f5eb1244c264fea2f9443adc04e178f34ea5b5e743e655a1411934011d285c4541368549416b7f395a71a145df5a5802b44ffd21bc6456b12f7c706da_1280.jpg","kind":"photo","author":"ArtisticOperations (Pixabay)"},"clips":[{"url":"https://pixabay.com/get/g6c70d91f5eb1244c264fea2f9443adc04e178f34ea5b5e743e655a1411934011d285c4541368549416b7f395a71a145df5a5802b44ffd21bc6456b12f7c706da_1280.jpg","kind":"photo","author":"ArtisticOperations (Pixabay)"},{"url":"https://pixabay.com/get/gaa459385aefbf17dcd38bc87c40fdd8c3598f1c9797729e45657bb5689a12c4b9535aea77239d63ab1ab986f011a6cfd5dc57057ad35c95242c76f1452ddec4f_1280.jpg","kind":"photo","author":"ukrtor (Pixabay)"}],"presentationOnly":false},{"text":"Comment below. Fuel takes a budget bite; next, let's look at diesel.","query":"diesel customer American station","subject":"diesel customer","visual":{"type":"poll","headline":"ARE FUEL COSTS SQUEEZING YOUR BUDGET?","items":["Yes","Not right now"],"sub":"What do you think? Comment below."},"clip":{"url":"https://pixabay.com/get/gb6efd2b35bdb8f13bfaf5c01d6b43cc4cf2e4b5e03926892d45de1d48411e356215c76bc3b1b1e1f3e08a12a88369a7ecb0707987f73b3219a6bf97aef695f6a_1280.jpg","kind":"photo","author":"planet_fox (Pixabay)"},"clips":[{"url":"https://pixabay.com/get/gb6efd2b35bdb8f13bfaf5c01d6b43cc4cf2e4b5e03926892d45de1d48411e356215c76bc3b1b1e1f3e08a12a88369a7ecb0707987f73b3219a6bf97aef695f6a_1280.jpg","kind":"photo","author":"planet_fox (Pixabay)"}],"presentationOnly":false},{"text":"Diesel averages about $6.28 per gallon nationwide today. That's a separate fuel price, not the regular-gas average.","query":"diesel dispenser American station","subject":"diesel dispenser","visual":{"type":"price_readout",